STUDENT SERVICE MEIN studspring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update // yeh basically btayenge spring ko tum jimedaari lo mere table ko create krne ki
                         spring.jpa.show-sql=true  // yeh kam kerga sql query dikhne ke liye command mein
                         spring.jpa.properties.hibernate.format_sql = true // krega record (Student) yeh beautifully arrange krega command mein sql code jaise

abb postman mein post dalkar body mein data bhejenge fir se unique check sql refresh and data add hone lgega